    "Rename file": {
      "comment": "Verb + noun, imperative: renames the file ON DISK so its name matches the note's title. Appears in the note metadata bar, as a link button in the multiple-selection pane, as the tooltip and accessibility label of a small toolbar-style button above the preview, in the note context menu, and in the File menu. \"file\" means the Markdown file on disk, as distinct from the note's YAML title.",
