    "Open Sample Library": {
      "comment": "Verb phrase, imperative, on a button in the first-run empty state, in Settings > Storage and in iOS Settings. It copies a small set of example notes and opens them, so the user can try the app without pointing it at their own files. \"Sample Library\" is the example notes folder the app ships with.",
