    "Double-clicking a note opens it here. Shokonotes itself never edits note contents.": {
      "comment": "UNUSED in the current code — superseded by the longer string that begins the same way and adds a sentence about the quick-note shortcut. Kept in the catalogue only.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-clicking a note opens it here. Shokonotes itself never edits note contents."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un double-clic ouvre la note ici. Shokonotes ne modifie jamais le corps d’une note."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Doppelklick öffnet die Notiz hier. Shokonotes ändert den Inhalt einer Notiz niemals."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un doble clic abre la nota aquí. Shokonotes nunca modifica el contenido de una nota."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un doppio clic apre la nota qui. Shokonotes non modifica mai il contenuto di una nota."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルクリックするとメモがここで開きます。Shokonotesがメモ本文を書き換えることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "메모를 이중 클릭하면 여기에서 열립니다. Shokonotes는 메모 내용을 절대 고치지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um clique duplo abre a nota aqui. O Shokonotes nunca altera o conteúdo de uma nota."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双击即可在此打开笔记。Shokonotes 绝不会改写笔记正文。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Двойной щелчок открывает заметку здесь. Shokonotes никогда не меняет текст заметки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
