    "Check the external editor in Settings (for example, Typora).": {
      "comment": "Informative text of the \"Unable to open external editor\" alert. \"Settings\" refers to the app's own Settings window — translate it as the key \"Settings\" is translated. \"Typora\" is a third-party application name and stays as is.",
      "localizations": {
