          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Dock badge uses the system label. Unsigned local builds often cannot display it.": {
      "comment": "Help text under the Dock badge toggle in Settings. \"badge\" is the small red count on the Dock icon; \"unsigned local builds\" means copies of the app compiled by the user without a developer signature.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Dock badge uses the system label. Unsigned local builds often cannot display it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pastille du Dock utilise le libellé système. Les builds locaux non signés ne l’affichent souvent pas."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Dock-Badge verwendet die Systembeschriftung. Unsignierte lokale Builds können es oft nicht anzeigen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La insignia del Dock usa la etiqueta del sistema. Las compilaciones locales sin firmar a menudo no pueden mostrarla."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il badge del Dock usa l’etichetta di sistema. Le build locali non firmate spesso non lo mostrano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dockバッジはシステムのラベルを使います。署名のないローカルビルドでは表示されないことがあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock 배지는 시스템 레이블을 사용합니다. 서명되지 않은 로컬 빌드에서는 자주 표시되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O distintivo do Dock usa o rótulo do sistema. Builds locais sem assinatura muitas vezes não o exibem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序坞标记使用系统标签。未签名的本地构建往往无法显示。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Значок Dock использует системную метку. Неподписанные локальные сборки часто его не показывают."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light and dark variants follow the window appearance. Highlighting stays local; nothing is loaded from the network.": {
      "comment": "UNUSED in the current code — kept in the catalogue only. It was help text for the code-highlighting theme setting; \"Highlighting\" means syntax colouring of code blocks.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light and dark variants follow the window appearance. Highlighting stays local; nothing is loaded from the network."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les variantes claire et sombre suivent l’apparence de la fenêtre. La coloration reste locale ; rien n’est chargé depuis le réseau."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helle und dunkle Varianten folgen dem Erscheinungsbild des Fensters. Die Hervorhebung bleibt lokal; es wird nichts aus dem Netzwerk geladen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las variantes clara y oscura siguen la apariencia de la ventana. El resaltado es local; no se carga nada de la red."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le varianti chiara e scura seguono l’aspetto della finestra. L’evidenziazione resta locale; nulla viene caricato dalla rete."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライトとダークのバリエーションはウインドウの外観に従います。ハイライトはローカルのままです。ネットワークからは何も読み込みません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "라이트와 다크 변형은 윈도우 모양새를 따릅니다. 강조 표시는 로컬에서만 이뤄지며 네트워크에서 불러오지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As variantes clara e escura acompanham a aparência da janela. O realce permanece local; nada é carregado da rede."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
