    "When a note has no YAML title, the first line of the body is used. Off: the file name.": {
      "comment": "Help text under the \"Use the first line as the title\" toggle (macOS and iOS). \"YAML title\" is the title: line of the note's front matter; \"Off:\" names the toggle's off state. Keep the compact \"Off: …\" construction only if it reads naturally in your language; otherwise write the full sentence.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a note has no YAML title, the first line of the body is used. Off: the file name."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans titre YAML, la première ligne du corps est utilisée. Désactivé : le nom de fichier."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne YAML-Titel wird die erste Zeile des Texts verwendet. Aus: der Dateiname."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si una nota no tiene título YAML, se usa la primera línea del cuerpo. Desactivado: el nombre de archivo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se una nota non ha titolo YAML, si usa la prima riga del testo. Disattivato: il nome del file."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YAMLのtitleがないメモは本文の先頭行を使います。オフ: ファイル名。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YAML 제목이 없으면 본문 첫 줄을 씁니다. 끔: 파일 이름."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando uma nota não tem título YAML, usa-se a primeira linha do corpo. Desligado: o nome do arquivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若笔记没有 YAML 标题，则使用正文第一行。关闭：使用文件名。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Если у заметки нет заголовка YAML, берётся первая строка текста. Выкл.: имя файла."
