    "Open the editor when creating a note": {
      "comment": "Toggle label in Settings > General > Editing. When on, creating a note from the toolbar or the File menu also opens it in the external editor. \"the editor\" is that external application.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the editor when creating a note"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir l’éditeur à la création d’une note"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Editor beim Erstellen einer Notiz öffnen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir el editor al crear una nota"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri l’editor quando si crea una nota"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メモ作成時にエディタを開く"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "메모를 만들 때 편집기 열기"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir o editor ao criar uma nota"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建笔记时打开编辑器"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Открывать редактор при создании заметки"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-clicking a note opens it here. Shokonotes itself never edits note contents. The global quick-note shortcut always opens the editor.": {
      "comment": "Help text under the external-editor row in Settings > General > Editing. \"here\" means in the chosen external editor. \"Shokonotes\" is the app name, never translated; \"quick-note shortcut\" is the global shortcut named \"Quick note\" elsewhere in Settings — keep the two consistent.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-clicking a note opens it here. Shokonotes itself never edits note contents. The global quick-note shortcut always opens the editor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un double-clic ouvre la note dans cet éditeur. Shokonotes ne modifie jamais le corps d’une note. Le raccourci global de note rapide ouvre toujours l’éditeur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Doppelklick öffnet die Notiz in diesem Editor. Shokonotes ändert den Inhalt einer Notiz niemals. Der globale Kurzbefehl für Schnellnotizen öffnet immer den Editor."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un doble clic abre la nota en este editor. Shokonotes nunca modifica el contenido de una nota. El atajo global de nota rápida siempre abre el editor."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un doppio clic apre la nota in questo editor. Shokonotes non modifica mai il contenuto di una nota. La scorciatoia globale per la nota rapida apre sempre l’editor."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルクリックすると、このエディタでメモが開きます。Shokonotesがメモ本文を書き換えることはありません。クイックメモのグローバルショートカットは常にエディタを開きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "메모를 이중 클릭하면 이 편집기에서 열립니다. Shokonotes는 메모 내용을 절대 고치지 않습니다. 빠른 메모 전역 단축키는 항상 편집기를 엽니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um clique duplo abre a nota neste editor. O Shokonotes nunca altera o conteúdo de uma nota. O atalho global de nota rápida sempre abre o editor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双击即可在此编辑器中打开笔记。Shokonotes 绝不会改写笔记正文。全局快速笔记快捷键总会打开编辑器。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Двойной щелчок открывает заметку в этом редакторе. Shokonotes никогда не меняет текст заметки. Глобальное сочетание быстрой заметки всегда открывает редактор."
          }
        }
      }
    },
