    "Line breaks in the file become new lines in the preview. Off: standard Markdown.": {
      "comment": "Help text under the \"Preserve line breaks\" toggle. \"Off:\" names the toggle's off state; \"standard Markdown\" means Markdown's normal behaviour of joining lines. \"Markdown\" is not translated.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
