    "Quick note creates a note in the Inbox and opens your editor, from any app. Showing and hiding the library never quits Shokonotes. Click the field, then type a shortcut. Delete clears it.": {
      "comment": "Help text under the two shortcut rows in Settings > General > Global shortcuts. \"Quick note\" is the name of the setting just above it and \"Inbox\" is the sidebar row — keep both consistent with those keys. \"Delete\" here is the Delete/Backspace key, not the app's Delete command; use the name printed on the keyboard in your locale. \"Shokonotes\" is the app name.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quick note creates a note in the Inbox and opens your editor, from any app. Showing and hiding the library never quits Shokonotes. Click the field, then type a shortcut. Delete clears it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note rapide crée une note dans la boîte de réception et ouvre l’éditeur, depuis n’importe quelle app. Afficher et masquer la bibliothèque ne quitte jamais Shokonotes. Cliquez dans le champ, puis tapez un raccourci. Suppr. l’efface."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schnellnotiz erstellt eine Notiz im Eingang und öffnet Ihren Editor – aus jeder App. Ein- und Ausblenden der Bibliothek beendet Shokonotes niemals. Klicken Sie ins Feld und geben Sie einen Kurzbefehl ein. Rücktaste löscht ihn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nota rápida crea una nota en la bandeja de entrada y abre su editor, desde cualquier app. Mostrar y ocultar la biblioteca nunca cierra Shokonotes. Haga clic en el campo y pulse un atajo. Suprimir lo borra."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nota rapida crea una nota in In arrivo e apre l’editor, da qualsiasi app. Mostrare e nascondere la libreria non esce mai da Shokonotes. Fai clic nel campo, poi digita una scorciatoia. Canc elimina."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クイックメモは、どのアプリからでも受信箱にメモを作り、エディタを開きます。ライブラリの表示と非表示でShokonotesが終了することはありません。フィールドをクリックしてショートカットを入力します。deleteで消去します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "빠른 메모는 어떤 앱에서든 수신함에 메모를 만들고 편집기를 엽니다. 보관함을 보이거나 가려도 Shokonotes는 종료되지 않습니다. 칸을 클릭한 뒤 단축키를 입력하세요. Delete로 지웁니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nota rápida cria uma nota na caixa de entrada e abre o editor, de qualquer app. Mostrar e ocultar a biblioteca nunca encerra o Shokonotes. Clique no campo e digite um atalho. Delete limpa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速笔记会从任何 App 在收件箱中创建一篇笔记并打开编辑器。显示或隐藏资料库绝不会退出 Shokonotes。点按该栏，然后输入快捷键。Delete 可将其清除。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Быстрая заметка создаёт заметку во Входящих и открывает редактор — из любого приложения. Показ и скрытие библиотеки никогда не завершают Shokonotes. Щёлкните поле и введите сочетание. Delete стирает его."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show or hide Shokonotes": {
      "comment": "Label of the second shortcut-recording row in Settings > General > Global shortcuts: the system-wide shortcut that brings the library window forward, or closes it if it is already frontmost. \"Shokonotes\" is the app name. Row label — the button sits on the same line, so keep it short.",
      "localizations": {
